-“Vall d’Àssua: De Altron a Sorre, Bernui, Saurí i Meneurí pels Camins Vells i tornada per l’Obaga i les Costes” 
es.wikiloc.com/rutas-senderismo/vall-dassua-de-altron-a-sorre-bernui-sauri-i-meneuri-pels-camins-vells-i-tornada-per-lobaga-i-les-c-15705444', '{"en":"This challenging loop to Pui d''Urdosa starts from the Biuse Huts, accessible via a track from the C-13 between Rialp and Llavorsí. The initial ascent is pathless, following a ridge with Civil War vestiges of the Pallars Front, including trenches and fortifications.\n\nThe route continues through the green meadows of Coll de Baladredo before a steep climb to Pui d''Urdosa (2226m), offering extensive views of Pallars. The descent is also pathless along the north ridge and Coll de Serelles, eventually joining the Camí de les Poselles and passing the Bedié Huts. This wild, unmarked terrain requires good orientation and is best suited for experienced hikers.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta circular al Pui d''Urdosa comença des de les Bordes de Biuse, accessibles per una pista des de la C-13 entre Rialp i Llavorsí. L''ascens inicial és sense camí definit, seguint una carena amb vestigis de la Guerra Civil del Front del Pallars, incloent trinxeres i fortificacions.\n\nLa ruta continua pels prats verds del Coll de Baladredo abans d''una pujada pronunciada al Pui d''Urdosa (2226m), amb àmplies vistes del Pallars. El descens també és sense camí per la carena nord i el Coll de Serelles, unint-se finalment al Camí de les Poselles i passant per les Bordes de Bedié. Aquest terreny salvatge i sense senyalitzar requereix bona orientació i és més adequat per a excursionistes experimentats.","es":"Esta exigente ruta circular al Pui d''Urdosa comienza desde las Bordes de Biuse, accesibles por una pista desde la C-13 entre Rialp y Llavorsí. El ascenso inicial es sin camino definido, siguiendo una cresta con vestigios de la Guerra Civil del Frente del Pallars, incluyendo trincheras y fortificaciones.\n\nLa ruta continúa por los verdes prados del Coll de Baladredo antes de una subida pronunciada al Pui d''Urdosa (2226m), con amplias vistas del Pallars. El descenso también es sin camino por la cresta norte y el Coll de Serelles, uniéndose finalmente al Camí de les Poselles y pasando por las Bordes de Bedié. Este terreno salvaje y sin señalizar requiere buena orientación y es más adecuado para excursionistas experimentados."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 12682, 991, 991, 2216, 1255, 'difficult', 'loop', NULL, 23100, 1237, '2021-04-25', '2020-05', '[{"lat":42.47548,"lng":1.212972,"ele":1261},{"lat":42.475529,"lng":1.213025,"ele":1261},{"lat":42.475632,"lng":1.213022,"ele":1259.1},{"lat":42.475645,"lng":1.213031,"ele":1259},{"lat":42.475695,"lng":1.212875,"ele":1255.9},{"lat":42.475674,"lng":1.212811,"ele":1255.3},{"lat":42.475644,"lng":1.21276,"ele":1255.1},{"lat":42.475527,"lng":1.212719,"ele":1256.2},{"lat":42.475425,"lng":1.212675,"ele":1256.6},{"lat":42.475345,"lng":1.21256,"ele":1255.4},{"lat":42.475323,"lng":1.212543,"ele":1255.3},{"lat":42.475312,"lng":1.212533,"ele":1255.2},{"lat":42.475172,"lng":1.2124,"ele":1255.9},{"lat":42.475115,"lng":1.212369,"ele":1256.9},{"lat":42.475106,"lng":1.21246,"ele":1259.1},{"lat":42.475133,"lng":1.212499,"ele":1259.1},{"lat":42.475181,"lng":1.212608,"ele":1260},{"lat":42.475189,"lng":1.212625,"ele":1260.1},{"lat":42.475269,"lng":1.212791,"ele":1260.6},{"lat":42.475358,"lng":1.212922,"ele":1261.9},{"lat":42.475476,"lng":1.213008,"ele":1261.6},{"lat":42.475457,"lng":1.213031,"ele":1262.4},{"lat":42.475438,"lng":1.213026,"ele":1262.6},{"lat":42.475278,"lng":1.213004,"ele":1264.9},{"lat":42.475205,"lng":1.212933,"ele":1266},{"lat":42.475177,"lng":1.21291,"ele":1266.5},{"lat":42.475021,"lng":1.212705,"ele":1267.5},{"lat":42.47494,"lng":1.212667,"ele":1270.8},{"lat":42.47493,"lng":1.212658,"ele":1271.1},{"lat":42.474866,"lng":1.212612,"ele":1273.4},{"lat":42.474745,"lng":1.212526,"ele":1276.9},{"lat":42.47464,"lng":1.212502,"ele":1278},{"lat":42.474536,"lng":1.212498,"ele":1278.9},{"lat":42.474482,"lng":1.212489,"ele":1279},{"lat":42.474463,"lng":1.212488,"ele":1279.1},{"lat"