....................................', '{"en":"This 7.1 km loop to Montlude (2,518m) starts from the Uishèra track, with parking available on the forest track. Access the track from behind the Vilamòs church, following the Camí de Sant Antoni. The route is a moderate ascent with 577m of elevation gain, making it a relatively accessible option for reaching the summit.\n\nThe trail passes through Coth der Estanh, Estanh Redon, and Estanh Long, offering a scenic journey through high mountain landscapes. It''s a well-defined route suitable for hikers looking for a shorter, less strenuous summit experience compared to other approaches to Montlude.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular de 7.1 km al Montlude (2.518m) comença des de la pista d''Uishèra, amb aparcament disponible a la pista forestal. Accediu a la pista des de darrere de l''església de Vilamòs, seguint el Camí de Sant Antoni. La ruta és una ascensió moderada amb 577m de desnivell positiu, cosa que la converteix en una opció relativament accessible per arribar al cim.\n\nEl sender passa pel Coth der Estanh, l''Estanh Redon i l''Estanh Long, oferint un recorregut escènic per paisatges d''alta muntanya. És una ruta ben definida apta per a excursionistes que busquen una experiència de cim més curta i menys exigent en comparació amb altres aproximacions al Montlude.","es":"Esta ruta circular de 7.1 km al Montlude (2.518m) comienza desde la pista de Uishèra, con aparcamiento disponible en la pista forestal. Acceda a la pista desde detrás de la iglesia de Vilamòs, siguiendo el Camí de Sant Antoni. La ruta es un ascenso moderado con 577m de desnivel positivo, lo que la convierte en una opción relativamente accesible para alcanzar la cima.\n\nEl sendero pasa por el Coth der Estanh, el Estanh Redon y el Estanh Long, ofreciendo un recorrido escénico por paisajes de alta montaña. Es una ruta bien definida apta para excursionistas que buscan una experiencia de cima más corta y menos extenuante en comparación con otras aproximaciones al Montlude."}'::jsonb, 'Willy Fogg', 7081, 577, 577, 2514, 1990, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 15780, 1326, '2021-06-09', '2021-05', '[{"lat":42.771349,"lng":0.764251,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771347,"lng":0.76425,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771346,"lng":0.764248,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771369,"lng":0.764227,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771384,"lng":0.764221,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771394,"lng":0.764223,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771392,"lng":0.764237,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771358,"lng":0.764272,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771353,"lng":0.764261,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771366,"lng":0.76427,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771418,"lng":0.764237,"ele":1990},{"lat":42.771492,"lng":0.764175,"ele":1991.5},{"lat":42.7715,"lng":0.764117,"ele":1992.9},{"lat":42.771504,"lng":0.764091,"ele":1992.9},{"lat":42.771509,"lng":0.763979,"ele":1994.3},{"lat":42.771507,"lng":0.763872,"ele":1996.3},{"lat":42.771493,"lng":0.763751,"ele":1997.2},{"lat":42.771489,"lng":0.763699,"ele":1997.7},{"lat":42.771476,"lng":0.763554,"ele":2000.1},{"lat":42.771466,"lng":0.7634,"ele":2002},{"lat":42.771446,"lng":0.76326,"ele":2003.5},{"lat":42.771425,"lng":0.763157,"ele":2005.4},{"lat":42.771405,"lng":0.763006,"ele":2006.8},{"lat":42.771393,"lng":0.762906,"ele":2007.3},{"lat":42.771353,"lng":0.762766,"ele":2008.8},{"lat":42.771319,"lng":0.762666,"ele":2009.7},{"lat":42.771292,"lng":0.762591,"ele":2010.7},{"lat":42.771271,"lng":0.762455,"ele":2012.6},{"lat":42.771277,"lng":0.762338,"ele":2013.6},{"lat":42.77135,"lng":0.762356,"ele":2016},{"lat":42.77141,"lng":0.762431,"ele":2017.4},{"lat":42.771487,"lng":0.762501,"ele":2019.3},{"lat":42.771554,"lng":0.762539,"ele":2020.8},{"lat":42.771624,"lng":0.762584,"ele":2023.2},{"lat":42.771656,"lng":0.762488,"ele":2025.1},{"lat":42.771652,"lng":0.762373,"ele":2026.1},{"lat":42.771651,"lng":0.762309,"ele":2027},{"lat":42.771665,"lng":0.762189,"ele":2028.5},{"lat":42.771673,"lng":0.762074,"ele":2029.9},{"lat":42.771686,"lng":0.761968,"ele":2031.4},{"lat":42.771719,"lng":0.761845,"ele":2032.3},{"lat":42.771776,"ln