Vídeos de Techos Provinciales', '{"en":"This long, difficult 24 km loop with 1883m of elevation gain explores the western Serra del Cadí, including the provincial high point of Barcelona, Costa Cabirolera. Starting from Pont de Serneres, the route follows the Serneres path to Josa de Cadí.\n\nFrom Josa de Cadí, the trail joins the GR 150-1, which can be poorly marked in places. A significant 500m ascent leads from Coll de Jovell towards Tres Canaletes, becoming progressively steeper before reaching the gentler, grassy summit slopes where chamois often graze.\n\nThis demanding route is suitable for experienced hikers seeking a full-day challenge with varied terrain and multiple summits.","ca":"Aquesta llarga i difícil ruta circular de 24 km amb 1883 m de desnivell positiu explora la serra del Cadí occidental, incloent el sostre provincial de Barcelona, la Costa Cabirolera. Començant des del Pont de Serneres, la ruta segueix el sender de Serneres fins a Josa de Cadí.\n\nDes de Josa de Cadí, el camí s''uneix al GR 150-1, que pot estar mal senyalitzat en alguns trams. Un ascens significatiu de 500 m porta des del Coll de Jovell cap a Tres Canaletes, tornant-se progressivament més empinat abans d''arribar als suaus pendents herbosos del cim, on sovint pasturen isards.\n\nAquesta ruta exigent és adequada per a excursionistes experimentats que busquen un repte de dia complet amb terreny variat i múltiples cims.","es":"Esta larga y difícil ruta circular de 24 km con 1883 m de desnivel positivo explora la sierra del Cadí occidental, incluyendo el techo provincial de Barcelona, la Costa Cabirolera. Partiendo del Pont de Serneres, la ruta sigue la senda de Serneres hasta Josa de Cadí.\n\nDesde Josa de Cadí, el camino se une al GR 150-1, que puede estar mal señalizado en algunos tramos. Un ascenso significativo de 500 m lleva desde el Coll de Jovell hacia Tres Canaletes, volviéndose progresivamente más empinado antes de llegar a las suaves pendientes herbosas de la cima, donde a menudo pastan rebecos.\n\nEsta ruta exigente es adecuada para excursionistas experimentados que buscan un desafío de día completo con terreno variado y múltiples cumbres."}'::jsonb, 'XimoT', 24011, 1883, 1883, 2643, 1344, 'difficult', 'loop', NULL, 32160, 2795, '2021-06-15', '2021-05', '[{"lat":42.259996,"lng":1.642107,"ele":1442.1},{"lat":42.259969,"lng":1.642083,"ele":1440.6},{"lat":42.259945,"lng":1.642038,"ele":1438.2},{"lat":42.259958,"lng":1.641959,"ele":1437.3},{"lat":42.259948,"lng":1.641854,"ele":1436.8},{"lat":42.260002,"lng":1.641686,"ele":1438.7},{"lat":42.260005,"lng":1.641678,"ele":1438.7},{"lat":42.260093,"lng":1.64156,"ele":1438.2},{"lat":42.260152,"lng":1.641462,"ele":1437.3},{"lat":42.26017,"lng":1.641441,"ele":1436.8},{"lat":42.260218,"lng":1.641284,"ele":1436.3},{"lat":42.260278,"lng":1.64115,"ele":1438.7},{"lat":42.260333,"lng":1.641024,"ele":1441.6},{"lat":42.260371,"lng":1.640889,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260357,"lng":1.640853,"ele":1443},{"lat":42.260317,"lng":1.640588,"ele":1443},{"lat":42.26028,"lng":1.640359,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260233,"lng":1.640174,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260226,"lng":1.640136,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260216,"lng":1.640088,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260209,"lng":1.640036,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260192,"lng":1.639936,"ele":1442.6},{"lat":42.260197,"lng":1.63973,"ele":1441.1},{"lat":42.260196,"lng":1.639719,"ele":1441.1},{"lat":42.260236,"lng":1.639589,"ele":1440.6},{"lat":42.260252,"lng":1.639356,"ele":1439.2},{"lat":42.260256,"lng":1.639206,"ele":1438.7},{"lat":42.260262,"lng":1.639069,"ele":1438.2},{"lat":42.260303,"lng":1.638934,"ele":1438.2},{"lat":42.260373,"lng":1.638618,"ele":1439.7},{"lat":42.26037,"lng":1.638454,"ele":1439.7},{"lat":42.260287,"lng":1.638329,"ele":1439.7},{"lat":42.260245,"lng":1.638094,"ele":1440.1},{"lat":42.260242,"lng":1.638076,"ele":1439.2},{"lat":42.260236,"lng":1.637884,"ele":1437.3},{"lat":42.260244,"lng":1.637839,"ele":1437.3},{"lat":42.260256,"lng":1.637748,"ele":1436.3},{"lat":42.260207,