('wikiloc', '76644954', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/farena-mola-de-roquerola-mola-destat-cogullons-baridana-alt-camp-conca-de-barbera-76644954', 'Farena-Mola de Roquerola-Mola d''Estat-Cogullons-Baridana (Alt Camp-Conca de Barberà)', '{"en":"Farena loop via Roquerola and Cogullons","ca":"Circular Farena per Roquerola i Cogullons","es":"Circular Farena por Roquerola y Cogullons"}'::jsonb, 'Farena-Mola de Roquerola-Mola d''Estat-Cogullons-Baridana (Alt Camp-Conca de Barberà) Hiking trail in Farena, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Circuit desde Farena pel PRC20 i GR171. Passa per llocs bonics i emblemàtics i també per d''altres poc freqüentats con la Mola de Roquerola i els cingles de la Cansalada.', '{"en":"This easy loop trail starts from Farena, utilizing sections of the PRC20 and GR171. The route explores both well-known and less-frequented areas, offering a diverse experience.\n\nKey points of interest include the Mola de Roquerola, the impressive Cingles de la Cansalada, the Mola d''Estat, and the Refugi de Cogullons. The trail is 12.9 km long with 664m of elevation gain, making it suitable for hikers seeking a moderate challenge with varied scenery.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil comença a Farena, utilitzant trams del PRC20 i el GR171. El recorregut explora tant zones conegudes com d''altres menys freqüentades, oferint una experiència diversa.\n\nEls punts d''interès clau inclouen la Mola de Roquerola, els impressionants Cingles de la Cansalada, la Mola d''Estat i el Refugi de Cogullons. El sender té 12.9 km de longitud amb 664m de desnivell positiu, sent adequat per a excursionistes que busquen un repte moderat amb paisatges variats.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil comienza en Farena, utilizando tramos del PRC20 y el GR171. El recorrido explora tanto zonas conocidas como otras menos frecuentadas, ofreciendo una experiencia diversa.\n\nLos puntos de interés clave incluyen la Mola de Roquerola, los impresionantes Cingles de la Cansalada, la Mola d''Estat y el Refugi de Cogullons. El sendero tiene 12.9 km de longitud con 664m de desnivel positivo, siendo adecuado para excursionistas que buscan un reto moderado con paisajes variados."}'::jsonb, 'LluísDC', 12859, 664, 664, 1145, 581, 'easy', 'loop', 14160, 21240, 2393, '2021-06-24', '2021-05', '[{"lat":41.31187,"lng":1.087278,"ele":633.3},{"lat":41.311901,"lng":1.087162,"ele":612.3},{"lat":41.311856,"lng":1.087165,"ele":612.3},{"lat":41.311827,"lng":1.087119,"ele":612.3},{"lat":41.311802,"lng":1.087065,"ele":610.5},{"lat":41.311796,"lng":1.087001,"ele":609.4},{"lat":41.311817,"lng":1.086942,"ele":608.8},{"lat":41.311849,"lng":1.086892,"ele":608.4},{"lat":41.31188,"lng":1.086842,"ele":608.2},{"lat":41.311891,"lng":1.086774,"ele":610},{"lat":41.31189,"lng":1.086712,"ele":613.7},{"lat":41.311891,"lng":1.08665,"ele":617.7},{"lat":41.311877,"lng":1.086592,"ele":619.3},{"lat":41.31184,"lng":1.086545,"ele":620.3},{"lat":41.311814,"lng":1.086494,"ele":617.1},{"lat":41.311812,"lng":1.086433,"ele":613.8},{"lat":41.311828,"lng":1.086376,"ele":611.8},{"lat":41.311837,"lng":1.086317,"ele":610.6},{"lat":41.311806,"lng":1.086265,"ele":609.9},{"lat":41.311772,"lng":1.086219,"ele":607.1},{"lat":41.311751,"lng":1.086166,"ele":605.4},{"lat":41.311784,"lng":1.086113,"ele":604.4},{"lat":41.311814,"lng":1.086065,"ele":603.8},{"lat":41.311835,"lng":1.086012,"ele":603.4},{"lat":41.311851,"lng":1.085946,"ele":607.4},{"lat":41.311873,"lng":1.085891,"ele":611.4},{"lat":41.311915,"lng":1.085857,"ele":615.4},{"lat":41.311965,"lng":1.085869,"ele":619.4},{"lat":41.312007,"lng":1.085835,"ele":615.7},{"lat":41.312017,"lng":1.085771,"ele":613.5},{"lat":41.312018,"lng":1.085709,"ele":615.2},{"lat":41.312014,"lng":1.085642,"ele":616.2},{"lat":41.312016,"lng":1.085581,"ele":614.1},{"lat":41.312022,"lng":1.085519,"ele":612.8},{"lat":41.312,"lng":1.085465,"ele":609.8},{"lat":41.312046,"lng":1.085452,"ele":607.5},{"lat":41.312098,"lng":1.085446,"ele":606.9