('wikiloc', '78498651', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/montlude-2518m-78498651', 'Montlude (2518m)', '{"en":"Long loop from Vilamós village","ca":"Circular llarga des de Vilamós","es":"Circular larga desde Vilamós"}'::jsonb, 'Montlude (2518m) Hiking trail in Vilamós, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Nice open hike with great views across the valleys and Aneto. 
Trail starting at the village of Vilamos..pretty village with bar ! 
 
I parked outside the church..take the small road behind church and head south up a small track.. 
signposting is a little vague on all of the trail. 
Follow the small track and then reach a larger forestry track, stay on this until reaching another track on your left..only marked with some cairns..continue past a hydro elec building..reach another track and stay left. 
Stay on this track..it flattens out and you have the feeling of not on the right one..keep going until a large hand painted sign on left and climb into the trees. 
From here there are no markings at all and the grass is quite long..a not very used track ..I got a little lost at this point and had to re trace my steps ..the gradient was quite steep. 
 
ADVICE 
If following my track..please follow on opposite direction as the return route is the correct one. 
 
Eventually you come out to a animal water point and a sign giving directions ..large open forestry track..follow this heading north east again for some time ..switch backs a few times and you reach a small col..no sign for direction here, but pass over the col and descend the other side towards Estang long Vilamos with two small huts at the end..here another sign..climbs over some rocks to reach Estanh Redon Vilamos..lovely small lake and superb views of Aneto etc..Good lunch spot and rest. 
Follow the small wooden markers up to Coth der Estanh..climb more steep here ...you reach a small area of small boulders.. take the left hand rout straight up . 
 I followed the wrong cairns again. 
So follow my reverse route to the summit ...', '{"en":"This 23.3 km loop to Montlude (2,518m) starts from the village of Vilamós, parking near the church. The initial section follows small tracks, then a larger forestry track, with vague signposting and some cairns. Route-finding can be challenging, especially through a less-used, steep grassy section where the track is faint.\n\nAfter some navigation, the path emerges onto a wide forestry track, leading to a small pass. Descend towards Estany Long Vilamós, passing two huts, then climb over rocks to Estany Redo. The route offers open views across the valleys and towards Aneto, but requires careful attention to the track, particularly on the ascent.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular de 23.3 km al Montlude (2.518m) comença des del poble de Vilamós, aparcant prop de l''església. El tram inicial segueix petites pistes, després una pista forestal més gran, amb senyalització una mica vaga i algunes fites. La navegació pot ser un repte, especialment a través d''una secció d''herba empinada i menys utilitzada on el camí és poc clar.\n\nDesprés d''una mica de navegació, el camí surt a una àmplia pista forestal, que porta a un petit coll. Baixeu cap a l''Estany Long Vilamós, passant dues cabanes, i després pugeu per roques fins a l''Estany Redo. La ruta ofereix vistes obertes a les valls i cap a l''Aneto, però requereix una atenció acurada al camí, especialment durant l''ascens.","es":"Esta ruta circular de 23.3 km al Montlude (2.518m) comienza desde el pueblo de Vilamós, aparcando cerca de la iglesia. La sección inicial sigue pequeñas pistas, luego una pista forestal más grande, con señalización algo vaga y algunos hitos. La orientación puede ser un desafío, especialmente a través de una sección de hierba empinada y menos utilizada donde el sendero es tenue.\n\nDespués de algo de navegación, el camino sale a una amplia pista forestal, que lleva a un pequeño collado. Descienda hacia el Estany Long Vilamós, pasando dos cabañas, y luego suba por rocas hasta el Estany Redo. La ruta ofrece vistas abiertas a los valles y hacia el Aneto, pero requiere una atención cuidadosa al sendero, particularmente en el ascenso."}'::jsonb, 'Dunblane40', 23255, 1537, 1537, 2514, 1251, 'moderate', 'loop', 20700, 27300, 3754, '2021-07-17', '2021-06', '[{"lat":42.747487,"lng":0.726813,"ele":1253.5},{"lat":42.747454,"lng":0.726876,"ele":1258.2},{"lat":42.747407,"lng":0.726891,"ele":1257.9},{"lat":42.747371,"lng":0.726949,"ele":1258.2},{"lat":42.747399,"lng":0.7269,"ele":1257},{"lat":42.747437,"lng":0.726837,"ele":1256},{"lat":42.74746,"lng":0.726784,"ele":1255.4},{"lat":42.74749,"lng":0.726734,"ele":1254.4},{"lat":42.747545,"lng":0.72663,"ele":1253.7},{"lat":42.747575,"lng":0.726565,"ele":1254.2},{"lat":42.747664,"lng":0.726539,"ele":1254},{"lat":42.747712,"lng":0.726573,"ele":1252.7},{"lat":42.7478,"lng":0.726667,"ele":1251.2},{"lat":42.747855,"lng":0.726705,"ele":1250.7},{"lat":42.747935,"lng":0.726771,"ele":1251.7},{"lat":42.747985,"lng":0.726821,"ele":1252.4},{"lat":42.748029,"lng":0.726856,"ele":1253.1},{"lat":42.748074,"lng":0.726887,"ele":1252.5},{"lat":42.748112,"lng":0.726953,"ele":1253.9},{"lat":42.748089,"lng":0.727016,"ele":1254.8},{"lat":42.748076,"lng":0.727083,"ele":1255.4},{"lat":42.748057,"lng":0.72714,"ele":1256.4},{"lat":42.748042,"lng":0.727201,"ele":1257.3},{"lat":42.748029,"lng":0.727267,"ele":1258.7},{"lat":42.748015,"lng":0.72734,"ele":1260.4},{"lat":42.747995,"lng":0.727396,"ele":1261.5},{"lat":42.74799,"lng":0.72747,"ele":1262.1},{"lat":42.747991,"lng":0.727535,"ele":1262.3},{"lat":42.74799,"lng":0.727608,"ele":1263.3},{"lat":42.747996,"lng":0.727675,"ele":1263.9},{"lat":42.747987,"lng":0.727738,"ele":1264.8},{"lat":42.747992,"lng":0.727809,"ele":1265.7},{"lat":42.747992,"lng":0.727874,"ele":1265.9},{"lat":42.74799,"lng":0.727948,"ele":1266.4},{"lat":42.747985,"lng":0.728012,"ele":1266.9},{"lat":42.747982,"lng":0.728087,"ele":1266.8},{"lat":42.747981,"lng":0.728163,"ele":1266.9},{"lat":42.