('wikiloc', '80216435', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/punta-dharle-des-de-cavallers-80216435', 'Punta d''Harle from Cavallers', '{"en":"Moderate loop from Cavallers","ca":"Circular moderada des de Cavallers","es":"Circular moderada desde Cavallers"}'::jsonb, 'Punta d''Harle des de Cavallers Hiking trail in Boí, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This moderate loop to Punta d''Harlé starts from Cavallers. While the raw description is minimal, the distance and elevation gain suggest a sustained climb suitable for experienced hikers. The route likely follows a well-established path, common for ascents from this popular trailhead.\n\nExpect varied terrain typical of the high Pyrenees, potentially including rocky sections and open slopes. The loop nature allows for different views on the ascent and descent, offering a comprehensive experience of the area around Cavallers.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada a la Punta d''Harlé comença des de Cavallers. Tot i que la descripció original és mínima, la distància i el desnivell suggereixen una pujada sostinguda apta per a excursionistes experimentats. És probable que la ruta segueixi un camí ben establert, com és habitual per a les ascensions des d''aquest punt d''inici popular.\n\nEspereu un terreny variat típic de l''alta Pirineu, amb possibles trams rocosos i pendents obertes. El caràcter circular permet vistes diferents en l''ascens i el descens, oferint una experiència completa de la zona al voltant de Cavallers.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada a Punta d''Harlé comienza desde Cavallers. Aunque la descripción original es mínima, la distancia y el desnivel sugieren una subida sostenida apta para excursionistas experimentados. Es probable que la ruta siga un camino bien establecido, común para las ascensiones desde este popular punto de inicio.\n\nEspere un terreno variado típico del alto Pirineo, con posibles tramos rocosos y pendientes abiertas. El carácter circular permite vistas diferentes en el ascenso y el descenso, ofreciendo una experiencia completa de la zona alrededor de Cavallers."}'::jsonb, 'Mireia P', 16335, 1488, 1488, 2870, 1724, 'moderate', 'loop', 13740, 43080, 2577, '2021-08-06', '2021-07', '[{"lat":42.584714,"lng":0.854917,"ele":1731.4},{"lat":42.584815,"lng":0.855083,"ele":1744.1},{"lat":42.584735,"lng":0.855067,"ele":1736.6},{"lat":42.584716,"lng":0.855146,"ele":1737.1},{"lat":42.584669,"lng":0.855135,"ele":1736.2},{"lat":42.584622,"lng":0.855116,"ele":1735.1},{"lat":42.584578,"lng":0.855131,"ele":1734.8},{"lat":42.584545,"lng":0.855177,"ele":1735.3},{"lat":42.584504,"lng":0.855212,"ele":1735.4},{"lat":42.584501,"lng":0.855288,"ele":1737.2},{"lat":42.58444,"lng":0.855306,"ele":1737},{"lat":42.584402,"lng":0.85534,"ele":1738.8},{"lat":42.584357,"lng":0.855311,"ele":1738.5},{"lat":42.58427,"lng":0.855349,"ele":1741.6},{"lat":42.584291,"lng":0.855442,"ele":1745.2},{"lat":42.584263,"lng":0.855501,"ele":1748.5},{"lat":42.584314,"lng":0.85547,"ele":1745.7},{"lat":42.584336,"lng":0.855531,"ele":1747.5},{"lat":42.584361,"lng":0.855583,"ele":1748.9},{"lat":42.584365,"lng":0.85565,"ele":1751.6},{"lat":42.584405,"lng":0.855707,"ele":1752.7},{"lat":42.584419,"lng":0.855774,"ele":1755.2},{"lat":42.584368,"lng":0.855771,"ele":1756.6},{"lat":42.584324,"lng":0.855748,"ele":1756.9},{"lat":42.584265,"lng":0.855787,"ele":1760.3},{"lat":42.584222,"lng":0.85576,"ele":1760.5},{"lat":42.584175,"lng":0.855754,"ele":1761.6},{"lat":42.58411,"lng":0.85572,"ele":1761.6},{"lat":42.584084,"lng":0.855664,"ele":1759.7},{"lat":42.584008,"lng":0.855712,"ele":1763.1},{"lat":42.58405,"lng":0.855743,"ele":1763.7},{"lat":42.58409,"lng":0.855703,"ele":1761.2},{"lat":42.584088,"lng":0.855768,"ele":1764},{"lat":42.584133,"lng":0.855795,"ele":1764.2},{"lat":42.584115,"lng":0.85586,"ele":1767.4},{"lat":42.584046,"lng":0.8559,"ele":1771},{"lat":42.5